{"path":"physics/models/conveyor/conveyor-belt","title":"模型·传送带","type":"knowledge","html":"<h1>⚡ 模型·传送带</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>适用特征</strong>：物体放上传送带，求加速时间/位移/痕迹长度/摩擦生热；水平与倾斜传送带。</p>\n<p><strong>风险提示</strong>：摩擦力方向由<strong>相对运动方向</strong>决定，物体速度超过传送带后摩擦力反向（先加速后匀速）；倾斜传送带还受重力分力，可能&quot;上不去&quot;。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>水平传送带（物体无初速放上）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>加速阶段：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=\\mu g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">μg</span></span></span></span>，加速时间 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=\\dfrac{v}{μg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.988em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span